# PHASE 1 - PROJECT INTELLIGENCE
# Purpose: Scan a Dataiku project and build the knowledge base
#          that all downstream phases depend on.
#
# HOW TO USE
# ----------
# 1. Create a Managed Folder named exactly "project_context" in this project
# 2. Run all cells in order
# 3. Outputs are saved to the managed folder automatically
